==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|yi}} {{term|שפּריץ|tr=shprits}} (the noun) and {{term|שפּריצן|tr=shpritsn}} (the verb).

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-spritz.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ɪts}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[sprinkling]] or [[spray]] of [[liquid]]; a small amount of liquid.
#: ''Fish is good with a '''spritz''' of lemon juice.''

